# LimX Dynamics HU_L03 Description(URDF & MJCF & USD)
## Overview
This package includes a universal humanoid robot description (URDF & MJCF & USD) for the HU_L03, developed by LimX Dynamics.
- **URDF**: HU_L03_description/urdf/HU_L03_01.urdf
- **MJCF**: HU_L03_description/xml/HU_L03_01.xml
- **USD**: HU_L03_description/usd/HU_L03_01.usd
- **srdf**: HU_L03_description/urdf/HU_L03_01.srdf (The SRDF file contains joint specifications such as rotor inertia and gear ratio)
- **meshes**: HU_L03_description/meshes/HU_L03_01
